*********************************************************************** 00010000
* This is the VM directory for the VM/370 Community Edition           * 00020000
*********************************************************************** 00030000
DIRECTORY 6A1 3350 VM50-1                                               00040000
                                                                        00050000
*********************************************************************** 00060000
* Next are the locked out areas for ease of mapping.  They mark       * 00070000
* things such as the perm area used by DMKSNT - the area for temp     * 00080000
* minidisks ($TDSK$) and also the spool/page area ($TEMP$).  The      * 00090000
* directory area is also mapped out this way.  The password of NOLOG  * 00100000
* prevents them being logged on.                                      * 00110000
*********************************************************************** 00120000
                                                                        00130000
USER $ALLOC$ NOLOG                                                      00140000
*        cuu type adr num volser mode readpw   writepw  multpw          00150000
 MDISK   101 3350 000 001 VM50-1 R                                      00160000
 MDISK   102 3350 000 001 VM50-2 R                                      00170000
 MDISK   103 3350 000 001 VM50-3 R                                      00180000
