*
* NICOF 0.7.0 (9.13d, devhawala/nicof, public domain): sockets API, FTP
* server and host files for CMS.  NICOFSRC 191 holds the proxies' files,
* 193 the NICOF binaries (accessed as N; NCFACC EXEC on 19E links it).
* The inside proxies NICOFPXY and TCPIPPXY are AUTOLOGged by AUTOLOG1;
* the outside proxy (nicof.jar on the PC) DIALs them on the 3270 lines
* of the Hercules groups NICOFPXY (03CD) and TCPIPPXY (03CE).
*
USER NICOFSRC NICOFSRC 15M 16M G
 OPTION ECMODE
 IPL CMS
 CONSOLE 009 3215
 SPOOL 00C 2540 READER *
 SPOOL 00D 2540 PUNCH A
 SPOOL 00E 1403 A
 LINK MAINT 190 190 RR
 LINK MAINT 19D 19D RR
 LINK MAINT 19E 19E RR
 MDISK 191 3350 061 002 VM50U1 MR ALL WRITE MULT
 MDISK 193 3350 063 008 VM50U1 MR ALL WRITE MULT
USER NICOFPXY NICOFPXY 3M 8M G
 OPTION ECMODE
 IPL CMS
 CONSOLE 009 3215
 SPOOL 00C 2540 READER *
 SPOOL 00D 2540 PUNCH A
 SPOOL 00E 1403 A
 LINK NICOFSRC 191 191 RR
 LINK NICOFSRC 193 193 RR
 LINK MAINT 190 190 RR
 LINK MAINT 19D 19D RR
 LINK MAINT 19E 19E RR
USER TCPIPPXY TCPIPPXY 3M 8M G
 OPTION ECMODE
 IPL CMS
 CONSOLE 009 3215
 SPOOL 00C 2540 READER *
 SPOOL 00D 2540 PUNCH A
 SPOOL 00E 1403 A
 LINK NICOFSRC 191 191 RR
 LINK NICOFSRC 193 193 RR
 LINK MAINT 190 190 RR
 LINK MAINT 19D 19D RR
 LINK MAINT 19E 19E RR
*                                                                               
* BORDER (9.12c): the guest LAN's only link to the PC.  An                      
* in-storage Linux (kernel #12 and BORDER EXEC on its 191) with                 
* eth0 on the LAN (10.3.0.1) and the CTC pair 0606/0607                         
* (10.1.4.2).  Start: CP AUTOLOG BORDER BORDER.                                 
*                                                                               
USER BORDER BORDER 64M 64M G                                                    
 OPTION ECMODE                                                                  
 IPL CMS                                                                        
 CONSOLE 009 3215                                                               
 SPOOL 00C 2540 READER *                                                        
 SPOOL 00D 2540 PUNCH A                                                         
 SPOOL 00E 1403 A                                                               
 LINK MAINT 190 190 RR                                                          
 LINK MAINT 19D 19D RR                                                          
 LINK MAINT 19E 19E RR                                                          
 LINK MAINT 290 290 RR                                                          
 DEDICATE 626 606                                                               
 DEDICATE 636 607                                                               
 MDISK 191 3350 071 020 VM50U1 MR ALL WRITE MULT                                
*                                                                               
* RSCS (9.13b): the NJE gateway.  SENDFILE to a user at another                 
* node spools to RSCS with a TAG; NJEGATE EXEC (19E) passes the                 
* file to NJE-II in the Debian guest.  AUTOLOG1 starts it.                      
* CE's RSCS V1 is RSCSV1.                                                       
*                                                                               
USER RSCS NJEGATE 8M 16M G                                                      
 OPTION ECMODE                                                                  
 IPL CMS                                                                        
 CONSOLE 009 3215                                                               
 SPOOL 00C 2540 READER *                                                        
 SPOOL 00D 2540 PUNCH A                                                         
 SPOOL 00E 1403 A                                                               
 LINK MAINT 190 190 RR                                                          
 LINK MAINT 19D 19D RR                                                          
 LINK MAINT 19E 19E RR                                                          
 MDISK 191 3350 091 010 VM50U1 MR ALL WRITE MULT                                
